      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "Cited as: WHO recommendations on antenatal care for a positive pregnancy experience. Geneva: World Health Organization; 2016. Chapter 1, Introduction. Quoted verbatim from the L1 text (line breaks joined). A candidate from another WHO publication, never the handbook's own definition.",
