      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Overview of the health interventions and WHO recommendations included within this digital adaptation kit (DAK). DAKs are meant to be a repackaging and integration of WHO guidelines and guidance documents in a particular health domain. The list of health interventions is drawn from the universal health coverage menu of interventions compiled by WHO (22)."
