          "@value": "Generic business processes and workflows"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "A business process is a set of related activities or tasks performed together to achieve the objectives of the health programme area, such as registration, counselling and referrals (1,23). Workflows are a visual representation of the progression of activities (tasks, decision points, interactions) that are performed within the business process (1,23)."
        }
